%article.page.container
  %h1 Examples
  %p
    Each page shows one Ruby file from the
    %code tests/_examples
    directory of the metorex repository, with the output the test suite checks for it when it runs as a program.
  %p
    = data<examples><count>
    files, grouped by the directory they are in:
  %ul.example-topics
    - for data<examples><topics> -> $topic
      %li
        %a{href: "##{$topic<anchor>}"}= $topic<name>
        %span.example-count= $topic<count>
  - for data<examples><topics> -> $topic
    %section.example-topic
      %h2{id: "#{$topic<anchor>}"}= $topic<name>
      %ul.example-list
        - for $topic<entries> -> $entry
          %li
            %a{href: "#{$entry<url>}"}= $entry<title>
